{"3880410":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Glisynth","steam_appid":3880410,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880410\/extras\/bc1ed3e6fc0d006c59dffaf3a8c69ea9.avif?t=1783175796\" width=798 height=288 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the game starts, notes fall down in sync with the music. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must press the correct key at the right time, when the note reaches the judgment line, to process it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880410\/extras\/c361bf6e8c11b17258ce5b9738adc418.avif?t=1783175796\" width=798 height=288 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two types of notes: White notes and yellow notes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880410\/extras\/90d5ef2bc9c58272221eb70eb567f292.avif?t=1783175796\" width=798 height=288 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To process a yellow note, you should press a key in the Q row of the keyboard, <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And to process a white note, you should press a key in the A row of the keyboard.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880410\/extras\/db3c727408f5ac58cd19aa6dc17cf096.avif?t=1783175796\" width=798 height=288 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more accurate your timing is when you press the key, the better your judgment will be. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will gain or lose life depending on this judgment.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880410\/extras\/5327e4a25f103e8e1382b1a35ec5cef0.avif?t=1783175796\" width=798 height=288 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the timing is correct but the keyboard row does not match the note color, an OFF judgment will be given. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You lose less life than a MISS, but be careful as it breaks your combo.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880410\/extras\/3a5cab75442fd53b9204738e014cf088.avif?t=1783175796\" width=798 height=288 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long notes refer to notes with a tail. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You process them by holding down the key for the entire length of the tail.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880410\/extras\/3d444a0119b63db31a4aed4a6cec0b2e.avif?t=1783175796\" width=798 height=288 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you finish the song with some life remaining, it will count as cleared. Pay attention to your life and try to complete each stage!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880410\/extras\/bc1ed3e6fc0d006c59dffaf3a8c69ea9.avif?t=1783175796\" width=798 height=288 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the game starts, notes fall down in sync with the music. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must press the correct key at the right time, when the note reaches the judgment line, to process it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880410\/extras\/c361bf6e8c11b17258ce5b9738adc418.avif?t=1783175796\" width=798 height=288 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two types of notes: White notes and yellow notes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880410\/extras\/90d5ef2bc9c58272221eb70eb567f292.avif?t=1783175796\" width=798 height=288 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To process a yellow note, you should press a key in the Q row of the keyboard, <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And to process a white note, you should press a key in the A row of the keyboard.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880410\/extras\/db3c727408f5ac58cd19aa6dc17cf096.avif?t=1783175796\" width=798 height=288 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more accurate your timing is when you press the key, the better your judgment will be. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will gain or lose life depending on this judgment.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880410\/extras\/5327e4a25f103e8e1382b1a35ec5cef0.avif?t=1783175796\" width=798 height=288 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the timing is correct but the keyboard row does not match the note color, an OFF judgment will be given. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You lose less life than a MISS, but be careful as it breaks your combo.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880410\/extras\/3a5cab75442fd53b9204738e014cf088.avif?t=1783175796\" width=798 height=288 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long notes refer to notes with a tail. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You process them by holding down the key for the entire length of the tail.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880410\/extras\/3d444a0119b63db31a4aed4a6cec0b2e.avif?t=1783175796\" width=798 height=288 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you finish the song with some life remaining, it will count as cleared. Pay attention to your life and try to complete each stage!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"Glisynth is a rhythm game that uses two types of notes. The Q row on the keyboard is used for yellow notes, while the A row is used for white notes.","supported_languages":"Korean, English, Japanese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880410\/bb72a0be7d55d44e173710a55b7921d7f45e2f9d\/header.jpg?t=1783175796","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880410\/11e79760563fca2a214a63948d1b39c1f01724c2\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783175796","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880410\/11e79760563fca2a214a63948d1b39c1f01724c2\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783175796","website":"https:\/\/discord.gg\/2sW9zb874V","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:<\/strong> Windows 7 \/ 8 \/ 8.1 \/ 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> x86, x64 Architecture with SSE2 Instruction Set Support<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/str